{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were just a tourist visiting New Zealand - but now you're  managing an underdog rugby club somehow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone expects you to fail. <i>You've never even played rugby before!</i> But you'll prove them wrong, challenge the champs, and win the Ramphorlie Shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/Tryhard_Battle2_ShortPalettized.gif?t=1739397086\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TACTICAL TURN-BASED AUTO SPORTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fresh blend of <strong>tactical RPG</strong>, <strong>auto battler</strong>, and <strong>sports</strong> genres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build the perfect <strong>squad</strong> from 15+ recruitable characters and dozens of skills inspired by real-life rugby.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outsmart</strong> other teams around the city across multiple seasons in a fully featured <strong>story mode.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RUGBY KNOWLEDGE IS OPTIONAL.</strong>\u00a0(It's OK, <i>many rugby players don't know anything about rugby either!)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/tryhard_characters_bust.png?t=1739397086\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MANAGE A SPORTS CLUB</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search for club sponsors and <strong>fundraise</strong> for new equipment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recruit</strong>\u00a0new members. You'll need a secretary, treasurer, and patron too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">File paperwork and <strong>send emails</strong>. Argue with the bank! <i>The possibilities are endless.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/Tryhard_Battle3_Big.gif?t=1739397086\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR OWN PATH</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a <strong>branching story</strong> full of love, betrayal, and community sports.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if you lose a match, the story mode continues, just like in real-life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage relationships</strong>, gradually earn your players' trust or make them hate you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/skyline_bg_cropped.png?t=1739397086\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LIVE IN VIRTUAL NEW ZEALAND</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> an embarrassingly authentic 3D recreation of T\u0101maki Makaurau / Auckland, the 5th largest city in Australasia!*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your\u00a0<strong>day job</strong>, pay the <strong>rent</strong>, and feed your <strong>dog</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But definitely <i>DO NOT</i>\u00a0<strong>fall in love</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(*) as ranked by urban area provisional resident population, June 2024.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/WishlistBanner_Dim.png?t=1739397086\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443270?t=1739397086","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/